{% doc %}
  Renders one article as a list item: a link with the image, the first tag as a
  label, the title and the reading time. The blog page (blocks/blog-articles)
  also turns on the excerpt and the date (TE-20 AC2, blog.md §1.6); the home
  page row (blocks/blog-posts) keeps the Figma 1:1022 card with no parameters.

  The image is decorative because the title already names the link, lazy unless
  the caller passes loading 'eager' for the LCP card. Without an image the card
  keeps its dark frame, so the white text stays readable. Without a tag there is
  no label. The title is never cut (decisions 11/11 (3)).

  Reading time (plan ES1-T169 D8): words in article.content at 200 words per minute,
  rounded up. An article with no words has no reading time, so it is hidden.
  Each tag gets a space before it so that words on either side of a tag or a line
  break stay separate; a tag inside a word counts that word twice.

  Meta: with show_date the line is "{date} · {N} min read" (`<time datetime>`,
  dot drawn by CSS, either part can be off); without it the line is the reading
  time only, as on the home page.

  Link name (TE-20 AC2, ES1-T506): the link wraps the whole card, so it points
  aria-labelledby at the title; its accessible name is the title only, not the
  tag, excerpt or meta. The title id is "{id_prefix}-article-{article.id}";
  blog-articles and related-articles pass block.id so the same article in two
  blocks never repeats an id. The home row (blog-posts) keeps the call with no
  parameters (AC8) and gets the default prefix.

  Test hooks: data-testid="article-card", "article-card-link", "article-card-image",
  "article-card-tag", "article-card-title", "article-card-excerpt",
  "article-card-meta", "article-card-date", "article-card-read-time".

  @param {article} article - The article to render
  @param {string} [heading_tag] - 'h3' (default) or 'h2' when the card sits right under the page h1
  @param {boolean} [show_date] - Shows the published date in the meta line. Default: false
  @param {boolean} [show_read_time] - Set to false to hide the reading time. Default: true
  @param {boolean} [show_excerpt] - Shows excerpt_or_content without HTML, 20 words. Default: false
  @param {string} [sizes] - The sizes attribute of the image. Default: the home page row
  @param {string} [loading] - 'lazy' (default) or 'eager' for the LCP card
  @param {string} [fetchpriority] - 'high' with loading 'eager' for the LCP card
  @param {string} [id_prefix] - Prefix of the title id, the caller's block.id. Default: 'article-card'

  @example
  {% for post in blog.articles limit: 5 %}
    {% render 'article-card', article: post, id_prefix: block.id %}
  {% endfor %}

  {% render 'article-card',
    article: post,
    id_prefix: block.id,
    heading_tag: 'h2',
    show_date: true,
    show_excerpt: true,
    sizes: '(min-width: 64rem) 25vw, 100vw'
  %}
{% enddoc %}

{%- liquid
  assign word_count = article.content | newline_to_br | strip_newlines | replace: '&nbsp;', ' ' | replace: '<', ' <' | strip_html | split: ' ' | size
  assign read_minutes = word_count | plus: 199 | divided_by: 200
  if show_read_time == false
    assign read_minutes = 0
  endif
  assign article_tag = article.tags | first

  assign card_heading = 'h3'
  if heading_tag == 'h2'
    assign card_heading = 'h2'
  endif
  assign card_sizes = sizes | default: '(min-width: 64rem) 336px, (min-width: 48rem) 40vw, 70vw'
  assign card_loading = loading | default: 'lazy'
  assign card_title_id = id_prefix | default: 'article-card' | append: '-article-' | append: article.id

  assign card_excerpt = ''
  if show_excerpt
    assign card_excerpt = article.excerpt_or_content | strip_html | truncatewords: 20
  endif
-%}

<li class="article-card" data-testid="article-card">
  <a
    class="article-card__link"
    href="{{ article.url }}"
    aria-labelledby="{{ card_title_id }}"
    data-testid="article-card-link"
  >
    {%- if article.image != blank -%}
      {% render 'image',
        image: article.image,
        class: 'article-card__image',
        width: 672,
        widths: '252, 336, 504, 672',
        sizes: card_sizes,
        loading: card_loading,
        fetchpriority: fetchpriority,
        decorative: true,
        testid: 'article-card-image'
      %}
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if article_tag != blank -%}
      <p class="article-card__tag" data-testid="article-card-tag">{{ article_tag | escape }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}
    <div class="article-card__content">
      <{{ card_heading }} class="article-card__title" id="{{ card_title_id }}" data-testid="article-card-title">
        {{- article.title | escape -}}
      </{{ card_heading }}>
      {%- if card_excerpt != blank -%}
        <p class="article-card__excerpt" data-testid="article-card-excerpt">{{ card_excerpt }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if show_date -%}
        <p class="article-card__meta" data-testid="article-card-meta">
          <span data-testid="article-card-date">{{ article.published_at | time_tag: format: 'date' }}</span>
          {%- if read_minutes > 0 -%}
            <span data-testid="article-card-read-time">{{ 'blocks.blog_posts.read_time' | t: count: read_minutes }}</span>
          {%- endif -%}
        </p>
      {%- elsif read_minutes > 0 -%}
        <p class="article-card__read-time" data-testid="article-card-read-time">
          {{- 'blocks.blog_posts.read_time' | t: count: read_minutes -}}
        </p>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </a>
</li>
